WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,270 --> 00:00:07,870
You are you, and the second girl is the second girl, with completely different personalities and character, so there is no need to be trapped by other people's gossip.

2
00:00:07,870 --> 00:00:10,840
Madam, it's time to take your medicine.

3
00:00:10,840 --> 00:00:16,280
My uncle has been making public announcements these days.

4
00:00:16,280 --> 00:00:19,000
Never returned home at all

5
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:25,050
Who left these traces?

6
00:00:25,050 --> 00:00:27,250
Thank you for coming to talk to me.

7
00:00:27,250 --> 00:00:31,240
Auntie, have a good rest. Yunlan will come back another day.

8
00:00:31,240 --> 00:00:42,880
Before my husband left, I was the housewife.

9
00:00:43,140 --> 00:00:46,340
There is a dossier announcing the peace secretly hidden in the study.

10
00:00:46,340 --> 00:00:48,740
Allow me to fetch it for her and put it away properly.
